{"Missing double-check after acquiring write lock in double-checked locking pattern. When multiple goroutines pass the initial read-lock check simultaneously (when cache is nil), they will queue up at the write lock, and each will perform the expensive cache loading operations redundantly instead of reusing the result from the first goroutine. The standard pattern requires re-checking the cache condition after acquiring the write lock to prevent this redundant work.": 0.9240321516990662}